.TH temporal-tui-profile 1  "profile "
.SH NAME
temporal\-tui\-profile \- Manage connection profiles
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtemporal\-tui profile\fR [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-\-profile\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage connection profiles
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR
Alternate config file. Defaults to the platform user config directory
.TP
\fB\-\-profile\fR \fI<PROFILE>\fR
Named connection profile
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
temporal\-tui\-profile\-list(1)
List configured profiles without resolving secrets
.TP
temporal\-tui\-profile\-show(1)
Print one redacted profile as TOML
.TP
temporal\-tui\-profile\-create(1)
Create a connection profile
.TP
temporal\-tui\-profile\-set\-default(1)
Select the default profile
.TP
temporal\-tui\-profile\-set\-api\-key(1)
Read an API key without echo and store it in the OS credential manager
.TP
temporal\-tui\-profile\-clear\-api\-key(1)
Remove an API key reference and delete its OS credential
.TP
temporal\-tui\-profile\-remove(1)
Remove a profile
